<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-PAKISTAN ALL OUT 191 VS NEW ZEALAND 155, 1ST TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN ALL OUT 191 VS NEW ZEALAND 155, 1ST TEST.</headline>
<dateline>LAHORE, Pakistan 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan, replying to New Zealand's first innings total of 155, were all out for 191 on the second day of the first cricket test on Friday.</p>
</text>
